rs","homepage":"https://docs.pola.rs","size":213763,"stargazers_count":36515,"watchers_count":36515,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":2510,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2662,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["arrow","dataframe","dataframe-library","dataframes","out-of-core","polars","python","rust"],"visibility":"public","forks":2510,"open_issues":2662,"watchers":36515,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/pulls/3901","html_url":"https://github.com/pola-rs/polars/pull/3901","diff_url":"https://github.com/pola-rs/polars/pull/3901.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pola-rs/polars/pull/3901.patch","merged_at":"2022-07-05T13:28:51Z"},"body":"…lection is used when reading a CSV file.\r\n\r\nAssign dtypes to expected columns when dtypes is a list and column\r\nselection is used when reading a CSV file.\r\n\r\nAs dtypes are passed to the polars CSV reader, projection and column\r\nselection was not applied on the dtypes in case it is a list,\r\nso the dtypes would be applied to the first x columns, instead of\r\nthe corresponding columns selected by the projection/column selection.\r\n\r\nA remaining issue that is not fixed:\r\n  Projection in combination with a list of dtypes which contain a\r\n  pl.Date type, are converted to null dates.\r\n  In case column names were used for the selection, the pl.Date type\r\n  will correctly convert that column to dates.\r\n\r\nFixes: #3891","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pola-rs/polars/issues/3901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confus